<http://data.silknow.org/object/3899814a-8747-32de-a5a5-f5c3f69fe9e6>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Handkerchief of plate-printed silk, England, ca. 1851"@en , "Handkerchief of plate-printed silk. Printed in black on a white silk taffeta ground and has a yellow border. The design has a distant view of the Crystal Palace in the centre, and with a symbolic group from all national standing around a statue of Mercury. There are allegorical figures in the corners symbolising the four continents, and a floral outer border."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/a8097d72-7402-33af-8191-98e6930c5e57> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Handkerchief of plate-printed silk. Printed in black on a white silk taffeta ground and has a yellow border. The design has a distant view of the Crystal Palace in the centre, and with a symbolic group from all national standing around a statue of Mercury. There are allegorical figures in the corners symbolising the four continents, and a floral outer border."@en , "Handkerchief of plate-printed silk, England, ca. 1851"@en ;
